WEBVTT

00:00:01.194 --> 00:00:02.701 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Signal is your

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:04.994 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
free first gate into Numinous.

00:00:05.312 --> 00:00:07.252 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
This is a preview of the work,

00:00:07.252 --> 00:00:09.346 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
not a receipt or proof of access.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:15.125 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
To enter, choose The Signal through Whop.

00:00:15.595 --> 00:00:17.418 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Afterwards, sign in to the same

00:00:17.418 --> 00:00:19.143 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
account and check its library.

00:00:19.557 --> 00:00:22.228 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
This storefront cannot grant access by itself.

00:00:25.237 --> 00:00:26.742 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Signal stays free.

00:00:27.073 --> 00:00:29.131 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
No card is required, and no recurring

00:00:29.131 --> 00:00:31.283 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
charge begins when you enter this gate.

00:00:31.606 --> 00:00:32.210 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Take your time.

00:00:35.237 --> 00:00:37.829 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Dispatches is where the record begins.

00:00:38.191 --> 00:00:40.640 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Follow announcements and upcoming realms there,

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.991 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
then return whenever a new vision calls

00:00:42.991 --> 00:00:44.852 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
your attention back to the work.

00:00:45.334 --> 00:00:46.898 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
You decide when to return.

00:00:49.222 --> 00:00:50.632 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The First Vision is an

00:00:50.632 --> 00:00:52.344 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
entry reading for this world.

00:00:52.763 --> 00:00:55.091 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
It introduces the chambers and gives you

00:00:55.091 --> 00:00:57.467 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
a place to begin before you explore the

00:00:57.467 --> 00:01:00.037 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
rooms available in your verified Whop library.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.955 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The rooms are a map, not a

00:01:05.955 --> 00:01:08.469 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
promise that this browser has unlocked them.

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:11.142 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Signal begins in the open; other

00:01:11.142 --> 00:01:13.650 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
spaces follow different parts of the work.

00:01:14.346 --> 00:01:15.511 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
In the Realm, a

00:01:15.511 --> 00:01:17.318 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
new being comes into view.

00:01:17.748 --> 00:01:20.157 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Let the image breathe before you move on.

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:22.416 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Stay with its atmosphere and story,

00:01:22.416 --> 00:01:23.893 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
and check your Whop account

00:01:23.893 --> 00:01:25.550 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
for the rooms available to you.

00:01:31.219 --> 00:01:32.893 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Process turns toward

00:01:32.893 --> 00:01:34.798 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
the craft behind the vision.

00:01:35.152 --> 00:01:38.744 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Records keep its names, context and story.

00:01:39.083 --> 00:01:41.706 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Together they make an image something you

00:01:41.706 --> 00:01:44.114 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
can return to rather than scroll past.

00:01:47.216 --> 00:01:49.656 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Session is a moment for questions

00:01:49.656 --> 00:01:51.620 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
and the next turn of the work.

00:01:52.026 --> 00:01:54.599 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Field Journal is space for your own

00:01:54.599 --> 00:01:57.440 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
notes as you follow what each vision becomes.

00:01:57.791 --> 00:01:58.813 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
There is no need

00:01:58.813 --> 00:02:00.420 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
to rush through either room.

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:04.411 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Sanctuary is a

00:02:04.411 --> 00:02:06.163 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
shared space around the gates.

00:02:06.579 --> 00:02:08.955 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Travellers can return to the work there and

00:02:08.955 --> 00:02:11.697 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
make room for one another's questions and discoveries.

00:02:12.234 --> 00:02:13.911 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The calendar marks the rhythm

00:02:13.911 --> 00:02:15.683 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
of future realms and announcements.

00:02:16.177 --> 00:02:17.636 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Look ahead, then return

00:02:17.636 --> 00:02:19.420 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
when the next chapter calls.

00:02:19.914 --> 00:02:21.677 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Follow it at your own pace.

00:02:22.125 --> 00:02:23.108 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
No other purchase is

00:02:23.108 --> 00:02:24.328 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
needed to keep The Signal.

00:02:28.247 --> 00:02:30.117 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
When you are ready, choose

00:02:30.117 --> 00:02:32.048 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
the free Signal gate below.

00:02:32.048 --> 00:02:33.255 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Your choice stays free.

00:02:33.746 --> 00:02:36.042 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
After Whop confirms your entry, read

00:02:36.042 --> 00:02:38.447 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
the First Vision and check Dispatches.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.169 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
A return page is never proof of access.
